---
version: "0.2.0"
dialect:
  csv:
    delimiter: ","
  csvx:
    formula_dialect: sheets
meta:
  note: >
    Formulas are stored verbatim, never re-quoted. The third data row shows
    a wrapped field whose formula contains " and , — the backtick region is
    wrapper-protected (SPEC §8), so the formula bytes survive untouched.
---
product,qty :int:,total
Widgets,12,42`=B2*C2`
"Gadgets, deluxe",7,69.93`=B3*C3`
Check,"`=CONCAT("a","b")`",99
